MAX_FILES: is 8
MAX_FILE_CHARS: defaults to 12000 unless ORLY_MAX_FILE_CHARS is set
evidencePaths: returns at most MAX_FILES paths, leaving out the skipped names
fileEnricher: records "[file does not exist]" for a missing path unless that path is soft
fileEnricher: marks a file longer than MAX_FILE_CHARS as TRUNCATED
combine: uses Promise.allSettled so one failing enricher does not fail the others
withEvidence: returns the turn unchanged when the evidence is empty
Enricher: takes a turn and specs and returns a Promise of Evidence
FileOptions: has a skip list and a soft list
